      "value": "This doesn't appear to be a bug report, and is instead what we'd consider a support request. This item will be closed.\nPlease contact our [Support team](http://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests/new) and report your issue there. Please include as much information as possible, such as game logs, screenshots, and etc. Video is also very helpful, if applicable.\nOur support team will get back to you as soon as possible.",
