  "details": "VRChat Version: 2022.1.1p2-1171-692ccb4080-Release\nDescription of the bug: Your connection to VRChat timed out.\nVery often I can't enter the game at all, and even when the game manages to connect it rarely stays online for more than a few minutes.\nYes I know there are like 1000 duplicates. What about you actually looked at some of them?\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): Launch the game\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):\nLog        -  [Behaviour] Connecting to realtime network\nLog        -  HTTPFormUseage:UrlEncoded\nLog        -  VRCApplication: OnApplicationFocusLost at 44.33894\nLog        -  [Behaviour] OnDisconnected: ClientTimeout\nError      -  [Behaviour] {{ NameServerAddress: 'ns.photonengine.io:5058', MasterServerAddress: '', GameServerAddress: '', Code: 'ClientTimeout', State: 'Disconnected', Time: '-1308626.838' }}\nLog        -  [Behaviour] Disconnected: ClientTimeout with Reason: \nError      -  [Behaviour] Timeout: Your connection to VRChat timed out.\nLog        -  [Behaviour] Resetting game flow because \"Your connection to VRChat timed out.\": [RejoinInstance, SkipLogin]",
